          "Watch for the limits that are not throughput at all. The control plane frequently breaks first, because metadata lookups, config propagation, health checking, and rebalancing scale with shard count rather than with traffic; cost breaks second, when a tier that was a rounding error at current volume becomes the largest line on the bill. A capacity model that tracks only the data path shows neither.",
